                        "name": "ManojKiran Eda",
                        "email": "manojkiran.eda@gmail.com",
                        "username": "manojkiraneda"
                    },
                    "message": "I appended this to the DISTRO_FEATURES via huygens.conf & based on the presence of this DISTRO_DEATURE i was adding the spdm_emu to the already existing spdm package. Does that sound okay ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-ibm/recipes-security/spdm-emu/files/ibm-enterprise/spdm-responder-emu",
